    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezekieli kuwikwa ni Mlungu ukaie mlindiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukaghora nani ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wa mdamu, dedanya na wandu wako kuwizere: Ngareda wuda isangenyi, waisanga wichaawika mndumu ukaie mlindiri wawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uo mlindiri ukawona m'maiza ukicha isangenyi, uchawighoria wandu kwa kukaba tarumbeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mndungi ukatoteshwa ni ugo wuda kwa kuleghatala lwaka lwa tarumbeta, bagha yake ichakaia aighu yake moni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasikira tarumbeta putu, nao ukaaleghatala moni; kwa huwo bagha yake ichakaia aighu yake. Angu na wei odesikira nao ukatala, kumangu wakirie irangi jake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mlindiri ukawona m'maiza ukicha, nao ulemo ni kukaba tarumbeta emanyisha wandu, mndumu wadima kutota. Uja mundu uchafwa kwa wundu ghwa ikosa jake loli, ela bagha yake nichaikotia kwa uja mlindiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa huwo ee mwana wa mdamu, nakuwika oho kukaie mlindiri aighu ya wandu wa Israeli. Iji kwasikira ilagho kufuma kwapo, kuchawionya wandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngamzera mundu mmbiwi kukaia uchafwa, na oho kuleghe kumghoria uo mundu mmbiwi eri upate kughaluka na kusigha wuwiwi ghwake, uo mundu mmbiwi uchafwa kwa wundu ghwa makosa ghake, ela bagha yake nichaikotia kwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela kukamghoria usighe wuwiwi ghwake, nao uleghe kughaluka na kusigha ugho wuwiwi, uchafwa kwa wundu ghwa wuwiwi ghwake, ela oho kuchakira irangi jako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mundu kusimamia malagho ghake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na oho ee mwana wa mdamu, ghoria wandu wa Israeli huwu: Inyo mwaawuyaghamba, ‘Makosa ghedu na kaung'a redu diribonyere reeka nyingi, naro raawuyadidarumisha; welee, dikaia wada moyo?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wizere, Sa iji koni ini Bwana MLUNGU nikaigha moyo, naghamba, Siboilwagha ni kifwa cha mundu mmbiwi, ela neekunda uo mmbiwi ughaluke na kurisigha chia rake mbiwi ukaie moyo. Ghalukenyi msighe chia renyu mbiwi, ee wandu wa Israeli; ado mfuyaki wandu wa Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na oho ee mwana wa mdamu, wizere wandu wako huwu: Hachi ya mundu wa hachi ndeichaamkira iji wabonya mawiwi. Kwa uo mundu mmbiwi, ndechaafwa kwa ugho wuwiwi ghwake, iji waghaluka na kusigha wuwiwi ghwake. Mhachi ndechaakaia moyo kwa hachi yake iji wabonya kaung'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata ngera namzera mundu wa hachi kukaia uchakaia moyo kwa wundu ghwa hachi yake, nao ubonye kaung'a, ibonyo jingi ja hachi yake ndejichaakumbukwa; ela uchafwa kwa wundu ghwa ugho wuwiwi waghubonya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena ngamzera mundu mmbiwi, ‘Loli kuchafwa,’ nao ughaluke na kuisigha kaung'a yake, na kubonya agho ghiko gha loli na gha hachi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukawunja mali orekopieghe, na kuwunja icho oresokieghe, na kughenda kwa kuinugha memu iredagha irangi, usebonyagha mawiwi, kwa loli uchakaia moyo, ndechaafwa anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndekuwadie ingi ya kaung'a rake oreribonyereghe ichaakumbukwa. Wabonyere agho ghiko gha loli na gha hachi, nao loli uchakaia moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sena niko wandu wako wawuyaghamba wei chia rapo si ra hachi kungi; na hoku chia rawo niro riseko ra hachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu wa hachi ukaisigha hachi yake na kubonya mawiwi, uchafwa kwa wundu ghwa agho mawiwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mundu mmbiwi ukaghaluka na kusigha wuwiwi ghwake na kubonya agho ghiko gha loli na gha hachi, uchakaia moyo kwa agho mabonyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena muaghamba wei chia rapo si ra hachi kungi. Ee wandu wa Israeli, nichamtanya kula mundu kunughana na mabonyo ghake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kughwa kwa Jerusalemu kughorwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
