        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wa mdamu, wandu wikaiagha andu kunonelo kwa isanga ja Israeli waawuyaghamba, ‘Abrahamu odeeka mundu umweri, nao ukanekwa iji isanga ujiwuse; isi dakaia wengi; loli danekelo iji isanga dijiwuse.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo kuwighorie seji ini, Bwana MLUNGU nawuyaghamba: Inyo mwadaja nyama iko na bagha, na kutasa milimu yenyu, na kubwagha wandu; welee, mwadima kujiwusa iji isanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakusaghika na lufu, na kubonya wuchafu; kula umu onyu waawuyakulusha kwa kulala na muka wa mmbao. Welee, mwadima kujiwusa iji isanga?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuwighorie malagho kukaia, Sa iji ini Bwana MLUNGU nikaiagha moyo, naghamba loli awo wawuyakaia andenyi ya andu kunonelo wichabwaghwa wudenyi, na uo uko cha mbuwenyi nichamfunya kwa nyamandu ujigho, na awo wikuvisire ngomenyi na mbangenyi wichafwa kwa saka izamie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichajibonya ijo isanga jisigho iduu putu, na iro ndighi wandu werekukasagha naro richasia; na mighondi ya Israeli ichasighwa miduu putu hata usoweke mundu oida aho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho niko wichamanya kukaia ini ne BWANA, ingelo nabonya isanga jisigho iduu kwa wundu gwa ugho wuchafu ghwawo ghose wereghubonyereghe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wuloli ghwa ilagho ja mlodi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na oho mwana wa mdamu, wandu wako waawuyaja malagho aighu yako kaavui na wurigha, na minyangonyi ya nyumba, wikizerana kula mundu na mmbao, ‘Choonyi msikire ijo ilagho jafuma kwa BWANA.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo wadaacha kwako sa ngelo rose, na kusea kidombo imbiri kwako sa wandu wapo, na kusikira agho kughoragha, ela ndewibonyagha sa iji wazerwa; kwa kukaia wawonyera lukundo kwa memu yawo, ela ngolo rawo rianugha fwaida rawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koowuya kwawo sa mundu uboragha chumbo ra lukundo kwa lwaka lusingie, ukilukaba na chombo charo; kwa kukaia wadasikira malagho kughorie ela ndewibonyagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iji malagho kughorie ghakatia, na loli ghichakatia; aho niko wichaamanya kukaia mlodi orekoghe aghadi kwawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
